ion del producto basada en las specs tecnicas (archivo: /docs/specs.md)\nC. Calcular el pre", "auto_quality": 9.47, "content_score": 8.67, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 1, "upstream_provider": "Seed", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "native_finish_reason": "tool_calls", "reasoning_tokens": 1656, "suite": "orchestration", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_seed-2.0-code", "prompt_sha": "2171c665c1a0", "response_file": "results/responses/seed-2.0-code/orchestration/parallel_vs_sequential_judgment__20260818_seed-2.0-code.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 8.667, "cost_score": 5.77, "cost_usd": 0.006, "speed": 8.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.607, "test_name": "support_escalation", "model": "Seed 2.0 Code", "model_id": "bytedance-seed/seed-2.0-code", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 54.1, "latency_first_token": 33.243, "latency_total": 33.243, "input_tokens": 430, "output_tokens": 1355, "response_preview": "Maria, lamento muchisimo que la intermitencia del servicio te haya generado perdidas de clientes y estres, eso no es la experiencia que queremos brindarte.\n\nPrimero, vamos a avanzar con las dos cosas que pediste inicialmente: voy a guiarte paso a paso para reactivar tu automatizacion de forma manual", "auto_quality": 9.47, "content_score": 8.67, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Seed", "finish_reason": "stop", "native_finish_reason": "stop", "reasoning_tokens": 1059, "suite": "multi_turn", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260818_seed-2.0-code", "prompt_sha": "bacea55ea45c", "response_file": "results/responses/seed-2.0-code/multi_turn/support_escalation__20260818_seed-2.0-code.md", "runs_averaged": 3}]}